OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping fines raise just
OL,4,A#3,000 in first year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has raised just #3,000 since
OL,7,Fit introduced a higher maximum penalty
OL,8,Ffor fly-tipping, it has been revealed.
OL,10,FIn September last year, Bradford
OL,11,FCouncil increased the maximum fine that
OL,12,Fcould be given to fly-tippers from #400
OL,13,Fto #1,000.
OL,15,FSince then, six fines of #1,000 have
OL,16,Fbeen issued for the offence, with just
OL,17,Fthree of those fines paid so far.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
