OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping fines raise just
OL,4,A#3,000 in first year
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a meeting of Bradford Council's
OL,7,FShipley Area Committee on Wednesday,
OL,8,Fmembers were told work was being done
OL,9,Fto tackle issues including fly-tipping,
OL,10,Flittering and dog fouling.
